'''Jeff''' (Japanese: '''ジェフ''' ''Jeff'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[BW102|Team Eevee and the Pokémon Rescue Squad!]]''. He is the father of [[Davy]] and [[Virgil]], and the founder of the Pokémon Rescue Squad.

He first appeared when Virgil, {{Ash}}, and {{ashfr}} were going to his office regarding the whereabouts of Davy. Jeff told him and the group that there was a situation regarding many Cryogonal at the dam. When Davy was trapped inside a building located there, Jeff wanted to go and rescue him, but Virgil told him to stay behind. In that case, he had Virgil and the group go to the dam and rescue him. He was last seen waving his farewells to Ash and the gang while they set off to [[Vertress City]].

