* Jeff is likely based on {{wp|Jeff Tracy}} from the 1960's TV series ''{{wp|Thunderbirds (TV series)|Thunderbirds}}'', who is also the founder and leader of a rescue organization, with his sons doing the actual rescuing while he supervises and coordinates the rescue missions from the base.
** In addition, Jeff's second-oldest son is named {{wp|Virgil Tracy|Virgil}} in the TV show as well.
